    "simplified_borders": {
        name: "Simplified Borders",
        description: [
            "### Simplified Statistical Borders",
            "Temporally sliced statistical and historical borders from CShapes-2.0 and Svea atlas.naissance.",
            "",
            "<details>",
            "<summary>Methodology & Temporal Slicing</summary>",
            "",
            "Historical sovereign boundaries are harmonised across two primary cartographic intervals:",
            "- **1886 – 2026**: CShapes-2.0 dataset with geopolitical territory modifications mapped to sovereign states.",
            "- **3500BC – 1886**: Svea atlas.naissance historical reconstructions of state control and tributary domains.",
            "- **Geodetic Generalisation**: Douglas-Peucker topological polygon reduction preserves spatial accuracy while maintaining 60fps rendering performance.",
            "</details>"
        ],
        filepaths: [
            {
                path: "${l_atlas}/CShapes-2.0.geojson",
                type: "vector.geojson",
                domain: [
                    1886,
                    2026
                ]
            },
            {
                path: "${l_atlas}/atlas.naissance",
                type: "vector.naissance",
                domain: [
                    -3500,
                    1886
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
