            "- **Antiquity (3500BC – 476AD)**: Early civilisational heartlands, Persian, Hellenistic, and Roman provincial borders.",
            "- **Middle Ages (476AD – 1356AD)**: Feudal subdivisions, Caliphates, and East Asian dynastic realms.",
            "- **Early Modern (1356AD – 1815AD)**: Golden Bull boundaries, Westphalian sovereignty, and Napoleonic redistributions.",
            "- **Modern (1815AD – 2025AD)**: Post-Congress Europe, decolonisation frontiers, and contemporary international recognition.",
            "</details>"
        ],
